    a rdf:Property, cccev:InformationRequirement ;
    rdfs:label "Periodically recorded information on the operating environmental conditions, including temperature"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "European Commission Battery Passport data point 70 (BR Annex XIII 4 (d)). Applicability as of Feb 2027 — EV: conditional (if applicable); LMT: conditional (if applicable); industrial: conditional (if applicable). Dynamic (folded from the EPCIS event stream at item level); access tier: legitimateInterest. Carried by eubat:timeSpentInExtremeTemperaturesAboveBoundary, eubat:timeSpentInExtremeTemperaturesBelowBoundary. Periodic recording is the EPCIS sensorElementList mechanism (sensorReport time series with sensorMetadata), not a master-data attribute."@en ;
    skos:notation "70" ;
    dcterms:bibliographicCitation "BR Annex XIII 4 (d)"@en ;
